WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.909
This is Hisaab, in one minute.

00:00:02.929 --> 00:00:06.746
Your books stay on your own PC. No account.
Free.

00:00:07.546 --> 00:00:10.696
Your company comes over from Tally in one
step.

00:00:11.396 --> 00:00:14.546
And Hisaab proves that every balance matches.

00:00:15.626 --> 00:00:20.577
The keys you know: V, F8, and a GST invoice in
seconds.

00:00:25.704 --> 00:00:28.253
Print it, or send it on WhatsApp.

00:00:29.747 --> 00:00:33.098
B opens the Balance Sheet, and Enter goes
deeper:

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:36.774
to the group, the party, the month, and the
voucher.

00:00:40.698 --> 00:00:46.915
GSTR-1, GSTR-3B and e-TDS come straight from
your vouchers.

00:00:47.995 --> 00:00:51.611
Screens in Hindi or Gujarati, with the same
keys.

00:00:53.363 --> 00:00:57.646
Every day, a backup by itself, and a copy in
your own cloud.

00:00:58.626 --> 00:01:01.488
Hisaab: your books, your keys.

00:01:01.508 --> 00:01:04.725
Watch the ten short chapters, and start today.

